# ROADMAP — OODAC 9/10 Lattice Goal (Draft)

File: openOODA/docs/ROADMAP.oot

This document records the 9/10 goal and survives LLM swaps. Every LLM reads ANCHOR.oo → NORTHSTAR.oot → this file on boot.

**Status:** Draft — pending your Final approval. Session goal `goal-bb5de491-6ee0-4fc2-9079-bc6f8e432f04` active, project memory `goals/9-10-lattice.md` pinned.

## Goal

OODAC 9/10 on safety/perf/security — best-of rustc/Go/Zig + keep OODAC lattice (20+26 caps, File[Opened] typestate, SECRET taint, SMT requires/ensures, self-hosting unique_fns, blackbox). No downgrades, no weird git alignment.

## Non-Goals

* No `0.1.0 → 0.0.3` downgrade — `VERSION 0.1.0` stays head, next is `v0.0.4` via PATCH+1.
* No `oodac` work while grok's branch is active — `phase-0-honest-ci` is now `main` at `324206c`, so clear.

## Decisions

* **D1 — Best-of baseline:** `rustc` as 10/10 for safety+systems, cherry-pick `Go` `net/http`/`go vet` and `Zig` `comptime`/`C` interop, keep Pony-like caps.
* **D2 — Lattice stays:** 20+26 caps SSoT `cap_table.json`, typestate 6 files, `k_pqc_hex_out` dedup, `blackbox` ring buffer.
* **D3 — Slices over big-bang:** ty enum → borrowck &/&mut → clang -O2 + real ll_emit → net/http over TcpCap.

## Constraints

* `<=256` lines/file, `.oo`/`.oot` only, Academy headers.
* `auto-release.yml` PATCH+1 on push; manual `target_tag` for MINOR/MAJOR.

## Risks

* `k_hex_out` duplicate (fixed `71574d2`) and `chs_rt.c` guard (fixed `2706e7a` etc) show `2-arg` migration needs all 6 repos green together — `oodac 34086377283` was `in_progress 7m+`, now at `324206c` with `=2`.

